                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019ve heard from far too many Nevadans who are worried about continuing to have health care coverage because they just can\u2019t afford the massive increase in premium costs.\n\nThere\u2019s still time to extend the ACA\u2019s enhanced premium tax credits and keep prices affordable \u2013 Washington Republicans need to work with us before it\u2019s too late.",
