                "reply_count": 47,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The fight for affordable health care is far from over. Now that we\u2019ve secured a vote in the Senate on a Democratic-negotiated bill to extend the ACA premium tax credits, it\u2019s more important than ever to work in a bipartisan way to reach a deal that ensures all Nevadans can afford insurance coverage \u2013 and I promise to keep doing just that.",
