                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our public health policy should be guided by science, not RFK Jr.\u2019s conspiracy theories. Vaccines are safe and effective and have saved millions of lives, including by eradicating diseases like smallpox and polio. This is dangerous misinformation.",
