                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump and Washington Republicans bent over backwards to pass permanent massive tax cuts for the ultra-wealthy, but they\u2019ve done nothing to lower grocery costs or prevent health care costs from spiking for your family.",
