                "retweet_count": 48,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Congress will only be able to lower health care costs for hardworking families if Donald Trump is on board to work with us. And @SpeakerJohnson is doing everything he can to prevent that.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nIf your health care costs go up next year, you\u2019ll have Speaker Johnson and House Republicans to blame. We cannot let that happen.",
