                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The cost of buying a home is at an all-time high, groceries just keep getting more expensive, and health care costs are spiking.\u00a0\n\nWe need to build an economy that works for everyone \u2013 not just those at the top \u2013 because every Nevadan who works hard and plays by the rules should be able to live the American Dream.",
