                "retweet_count": 48,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump says he would \u201crather not\u201d help millions of Americans afford health care coverage.\n\nDemocrats haven't stopped fighting to extend these tax credits, and we won't give up. If your health care costs spike, Trump will be to blame. He can prevent this by working with us.",
