                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If Senate Republicans block a clean extension of the ACA premium tax credits, health care costs will go up by hundreds or even thousands of dollars for hardworking families.\n\nDemocrats have worked in good faith for months to try to stop this massive spike in costs. It seems Washington Republicans just don\u2019t care.",
