                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Health care costs are too high, and I\u2019m working to lower prices in any way I can.\n\nProud to introduce a bipartisan bill with @SenJohnCurtis to help lower the cost of prescription drugs and medical devices like insulin pumps, all while creating jobs.",
