                "text": "Nevadans are seeing their insurance premiums go up by hundreds or even thousands of dollars because Washington Republicans have refused to take action to address this massive spike in health care costs.\n\nI\u2019ll be voting YES on a bill to extend the ACA premium tax credits later this week. Thousands of Nevadans will lose their insurance coverage if Senate Republicans block it.",
