                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It seems to be easy for my Republican colleagues to vote to take away health care from hardworking families while they themselves get to have government-subsidized health care.\n\nI'd like to issue a challenge to Senate Republicans: if you vote against extending the ACA tax credits, go without health insurance for you and your family for a year. Walk a mile in the shoes of families who are going to lose their care because of you.",
